; Picture: the door at the left edge of room 20, rows 16-19
;
; Draws a 1x4 picture of the door (tiles $BC-$BF) at row 16, column 0. Run by room 20 (op $95) while #R$851C, the
; lever of room 9, is 0.
@label=DoorLeftLow
b$7F87 DEFB $91,$BC,$01,$04,$01,$10,$00 ; PICTURES tiles from $BC, 1x4, at 1 positions
 $7F8E DEFB $80             ; END
